\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since ${A}^{T}\\cdot A=I,$ our matrix is orthogonal.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186284755 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133948 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b9017b4e-ddb3-56f6-ba30-b494a7e4e09f" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Orthogonal Matrices" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049606 :topic/id #uuid "03f0df59-343c-5dd7-ad4a-b7bacf1e1f44" :topic/math-academy-id 2105 :topic/title "Orthogonal Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b83cbcb7-0b07-5ebc-aa53-89e2be0b52df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450114} {:answer/id #uuid "a563d8ec-88fc-5fd2-9125-f7a62ee49b1f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450115}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a563d8ec-88fc-5fd2-9125-f7a62ee49b1f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450115} :answer-field/id #uuid "f129ca4a-c8e7-580b-91d4-1a0d29e6e4ed" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451011} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dda02671-8980-5223-a56e-89f2f6a71af7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450116} {:answer/id #uuid "72a3e0ac-77bc-591c-8e67-8888858b7e84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450117}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dda02671-8980-5223-a56e-89f2f6a71af7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450116} :answer-field/id #uuid "e642b