ct all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "The Cartesian product $Z\\times Z$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $Z$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $Z.$\n\nIn this case, the schematic for ${Z}^{2}=Z\\times Z$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/fa/fa14e54c0518f8f5e64d3ccb4f725bd0b3804fb197d7b90320398ebbf09d68d4.png)\n\nHence, the set $Y=Z\\times Z$ is given by\n\n$$\nY={(t,t),(t,u)(u,t),(u,u)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287795 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054634 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6128eca-7f76-5386-9d67-d81db2943eeb" :knowledge-point/title "Computing a Cartesian Product" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050432 :topic/id #uuid "48930849-af42-52a8-8e89-28eb54e1d4a5" :topic/math-academy-id 49 :topic/title "The Cartesian Product"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "91f809ca-0f0e-5928-aaf3-75099caebdc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450138} {:answer/id #uuid "0a6343da-43d1-5e19-91dd-f701db7355f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450139}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91f809ca-0f0e-5928-aaf3-75099caebdc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450138} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b97fb6a-64fc-5b59-add5-c689202db96b" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451023} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f2dbf9d4-9ad4-57b6-b96a-e243ae870a6c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450140} {:answer/id #uuid "b1e15bdc-8f44-59b2